    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d546">

                <pb facs="0476" n="360" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg360"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.00/1024.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Blanchard.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-11-16T11:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 16, 1914, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your November 13, 3 p.m. Department desires you to carry out instructions
                    contained in its November 12, 2 p.m. Add paragraph sixth, Haitian commission to
                    be empowered to sign a protocol for the settlement by arbitration of pending
                    claims of American citizens against Haiti.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
